# 💼 Practical Scenario

## Employee Resignation

### Process

1. Verify HR or manager approval.
2. Open Active Directory Users and Computers.
3. Locate the user account.
4. Disable the account.
5. Remove unnecessary access according to company policy.
6. Preserve company data and mailbox.
7. Document the account changes.
8. Notify the appropriate manager that access has been removed.

